/'EVAL' FOUND A REPLACEMENT OPERATOR (=): STACK THE
/ LAST OPERATION AND LOCK THE VARIABLE IN POSITION.

	*TAD FENT&177	/WIERD!
EQLS,	0		/PLACED HERE TO SAVE A WORD
	TAD CHAR
	TAD MEQ
	SZA CLA
	JMP I EQLS
