EVAL,	DCA LASTOP	/EVALUATION CONTROLLER
	TESTC		/TEST CHARACTER & IGNORE SPACES
	JMP ETERM1	/TERMINATOR
	JMP EFUN	/FUNCTION
	JMP ENUM	/NUMBER
	PUSHJ		/LETTER OF VARIABLE
	    GETVAR	/LOOKUP THE NAME
